      "title": "Note: Qwen-Image 2.1 Viewpoint Orbit & 360\u00b0 Turntable",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \ud83d\udd04 Qwen-Image 2.1 Viewpoint Orbit & 360\u00b0 Turntable Pipeline\n\nGenerate novel camera viewpoints or complete 360\u00b0 turntable loops from any single image with automatic background removal.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\ude80 Quick Start Guide\n\n1. **Upload Subject**:\n   - Put any photo or object image into **LoadImage** (Node 6).\n   - Solid, textured, or real-world backgrounds are automatically stripped by **RMBG** (Node 17).\n   - *(Tip: If your input image already has transparent alpha, select Node 17 and press `Ctrl + B` to bypass).*\n\n2. **Select Orbit Mode (Node 13)**:\n   - **`Full 360\u00b0 Turntable (8 Views)`**:\n     - Generates all 8 unified viewpoint angles in sequence with **1 click on Queue Prompt**.\n     - Automatically creates a smooth 360\u00b0 loop with 100% matching lighting.\n   - **`Patch Single Frame`**:\n     - If one angle needs a reroll (e.g. `180` back view), select `camera_angle` and queue!\n     - Only that single angle runs and surgically replaces that slot in your saved turntable.\n   - **`Single View (Standalone)`**:\n     - Generates 1 single novel view without turntable buffering.\n\n3. **Inspect in 360\u00b0 Viewer (Node 16)**:\n   - **Drag to Spin**: Click and drag horizontally across the viewport to smoothly inspect the 3D rotation.\n   - **3D Orbit Ring**: Camera handle (`\ud83d\udcf7`) orbits along the perspective ellipse showing exact camera position.\n   - **Interactive Ribbon**: Click any angle card for instant snapping. Auto-jumps to patched frame!\n   - **Auto-Play & Speed**: Click `\u25b6 Play` to auto-rotate. Use `\u23f1 0.5x` to cycle speed (0.5x, 1x, 0.25x, 2x).\n   - **Quick Save**: Click `\ud83d\udcbe Save Frame` to instantly download the currently viewed angle as a transparent PNG.\n\n4. **Multi-Format Export (Node 15)**:\n   - **`export_mp4`**: High-definition looping H.264 video (`.mp4`) with customizable background color.\n   - **`export_webp`**: Looping transparent animated `.webp` for web & Discord.\n   - **`export_frames`**: 8 separate numbered & angle-labeled `.png` frames preserving full RGBA alpha transparency.\n\n---\n\n### \u2699\ufe0f Sampler & Model Settings (8GB VRAM Safe)\n- **Diffusion Model**: `qwen_image_2.1_Q5_K_M.gguf` (UnetLoaderGGUF)\n- **Orbit LoRA**: `orbit_alpha_lora.safetensors` (Strength: 1.0)\n- **Text Encoder**: `qwen3vl_8b_w4a8.safetensors` (Type: `qwen_image`, avoids CUDA OOM)\n- **VAE**: `qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors`\n- **Background Removal**: `RMBG-2.0` (BiRefNet architecture)\n- **Sampler / Steps**: `euler` / `simple` / `28` steps (fast) or `40` steps (high quality) / `cfg: 1.0`\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# \ud83d\udd04 Qwen-Image 2.1 Viewpoint Orbit & 360\u00b0 Turntable Pipeline\n\nGenerate novel camera viewpoints or complete 360\u00b0 turntable loops from any single image with automatic background removal.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\ude80 Quick Start Guide\n\n1. **Upload Subject**:\n   - Put any photo or object image into **LoadImage** (Node 6).\n   - Solid, textured, or real-world backgrounds are automatically stripped by **RMBG** (Node 17).\n   - *(Tip: If your input image already has transparent alpha, select Node 17 and press `Ctrl + B` to bypass).*\n\n2. **Select Orbit Mode (Node 13)**:\n   - **`Full 360\u00b0 Turntable (8 Views)`**:\n     - Generates all 8 unified viewpoint angles in sequence with **1 click on Queue Prompt**.\n     - Automatically creates a smooth 360\u00b0 loop with 100% matching lighting.\n   - **`Patch Single Frame`**:\n     - If one angle needs a reroll (e.g. `180` back view), select `camera_angle` and queue!\n     - Only that single angle runs and surgically replaces that slot in your saved turntable.\n   - **`Single View (Standalone)`**:\n     - Generates 1 single novel view without turntable buffering.\n\n3. **Inspect in 360\u00b0 Viewer (Node 16)**:\n   - **Drag to Spin**: Click and drag horizontally across the viewport to smoothly inspect the 3D rotation.\n   - **3D Orbit Ring**: Camera handle (`\ud83d\udcf7`) orbits along the perspective ellipse showing exact camera position.\n   - **Interactive Ribbon**: Click any angle card for instant snapping. Auto-jumps to patched frame!\n   - **Auto-Play & Speed**: Click `\u25b6 Play` to auto-rotate. Use `\u23f1 0.5x` to cycle speed (0.5x, 1x, 0.25x, 2x).\n   - **Quick Save**: Click `\ud83d\udcbe Save Frame` to instantly download the currently viewed angle as a transparent PNG.\n\n4. **Multi-Format Export (Node 15)**:\n   - **`export_mp4`**: High-definition looping H.264 video (`.mp4`) with customizable background color.\n   - **`export_webp`**: Looping transparent animated `.webp` for web & Discord.\n   - **`export_frames`**: 8 separate numbered & angle-labeled `.png` frames preserving full RGBA alpha transparency.\n\n---\n\n### \u2699\ufe0f Sampler & Model Settings (8GB VRAM Safe)\n- **Diffusion Model**: `qwen_image_2.1_Q5_K_M.gguf` (UnetLoaderGGUF)\n- **Orbit LoRA**: `orbit_alpha_lora.safetensors` (Strength: 1.0)\n- **Text Encoder**: `qwen3vl_8b_w4a8.safetensors` (Type: `qwen_image`, avoids CUDA OOM)\n- **VAE**: `qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors`\n- **Background Removal**: `RMBG-2.0` (BiRefNet architecture)\n- **Sampler / Steps**: `euler` / `simple` / `28` steps (fast) or `40` steps (high quality) / `cfg: 1.0`\n"
      },
